[
  {
    "id": "89bec57d-9528-5499-ac0d-283b57d60bd9",
    "pack": "bastion-of-blasphemies",
    "kind": "action",
    "slug": "action:entertain-the-fishers",
    "name": "Entertain the Fishers",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "bastion-of-blasphemies"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Each PC goes one at a time in an order of the party's choosing, with every activity taking 5 minutes to perform. The skill checks required for either option vary, but the results for them are all the same."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Drink and Boast:",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " A PC who chooses this option drinks a tankard of potent Arudora ale, then attempts to delight the gathering with a rousing tale of fishing or hunting. First, the PC must succeed at a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:fortitude",
            "dc": 24
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save to avoid becoming "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "5cfa1065-86f1-5622-a7de-7c91351dcdb8",
            "label": "Sickened 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " ("
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "5cfa1065-86f1-5622-a7de-7c91351dcdb8",
            "label": "Sickened 2"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " on a critical failure) by the drink, and next, they must immediately begin their story without taking time to retch or recover from any sickened condition they might have gained. The gathered fishers enjoy hyperbole and stretched truths more than factual accounts, so the PC can either attempt a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "skill:deception",
            "dc": 22
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " check (to spin a tall tale) or a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "skill:survival",
            "dc": 26
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " check (to tell a legitimate story)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Brawl with Arth:",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " A PC who chooses this option spends several minutes boasting about their strength and fighting prowess, then tangles with Arth in a short exhibition match fought not to the death, but to humiliation. The PC must attempt a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "skill:athletics",
            "dc": 24
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " check to beat Arth fair and square or a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "skill:intimidation",
            "dc": 26
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " check to match and exceed Arth's challenges."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Regardless of the option chosen, each skill check has the following results."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The PC entertains 6 of the fishers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The PC entertains 3 of the fishers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The PC fails to entertain any of the fishers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The PC bores the fishers. If there are any fishers currently entertained, 3 of them are no longer entertained. If the PC was attempting to Drink and Boast, something in the ale lingers, and they become "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "9e1dad43-36fe-5629-923f-2df63c12d90f",
            "label": "Stupefied 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for 24 hours. If the PC was attempting to Brawl with Arth, they pull a muscle and become "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "5aa15fa8-99a7-56a4-8237-f605177275dd",
            "label": "Enfeebled 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for 24 hours."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.276zNoegM7xXuEIw"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "interaction"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "c1bbe736-493f-5268-9ebc-11eb6ba7ff5e",
    "pack": "bastion-of-blasphemies",
    "kind": "action",
    "slug": "action:escape-mums-embrace",
    "name": "Escape Mum's Embrace",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["exploration", "manipulate"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "bastion-of-blasphemies"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You spend a minute attempting to escape from Danrasteian's device even as the contraption works to tighten its bindings and twist you into increasingly uncomfortable positions. Attempt a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "skill:thievery",
            "dc": 24
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " check to manipulate connectors and fasteners on the device to degrade their hold, a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "skill:acrobatics",
            "dc": 25
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " check to contort yourself into a more advantageous position, a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "skill:athletics",
            "dc": 26
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " check to tug at the bindings and loosen their grip, or a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:reflex",
            "dc": 29,
            "outcomes": {
              "criticalSuccess": [
                { "type": "text", "text": "You make significant progress toward escaping and earn 2 Freedom Points." }
              ],
              "success": [{ "type": "text", "text": "You're on the way to escaping and earn 1 Freedom Point." }],
              "failure": [
                { "type": "text", "text": "You fail to make any progress toward escaping and take " },
                { "type": "damage", "instances": [{ "formula": "2d8", "damageType": "bludgeoning" }] },
                { "type": "text", "text": " damage from being twisted up." }
              ],
              "criticalFailure": [
                { "type": "text", "text": "As failure, but " },
                { "type": "damage", "instances": [{ "formula": "4d8", "damageType": "bludgeoning" }] },
                { "type": "text", "text": " damage. In addition, you must attempt a " },
                { "type": "check", "statistic": "save:fortitude", "dc": 24, "options": ["inflicts:drained"] },
                { "type": "text", "text": " save to resist having your " },
                { "type": "ref", "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b" },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " condition value increase by 1 as your bones begin to break and your joints start to dislocate."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save to simply wriggle and stretch in an attempt to squirm free, with the following results. (Any bonus that applies to any attempt to Escape applies to these checks.) Once you earn 3 Freedom Points, you escape!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You make significant progress toward escaping and earn 2 Freedom Points."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You're on the way to escaping and earn 1 Freedom Point."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You fail to make any progress toward escaping and take "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "2d8",
                "damageType": "bludgeoning"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage from being twisted up."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " As failure, but "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "4d8",
                "damageType": "bludgeoning"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage. In addition, you must attempt a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:fortitude",
            "dc": 24,
            "options": ["inflicts:drained"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save to resist having your "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " condition value increase by 1 as your bones begin to break and your joints start to dislocate."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.lsrjaHoc5KZs177E"
    },
