  {
    "id": "24c90988-41ed-5430-9fc4-45748adb6387",
    "pack": "bastion-of-blasphemies",
    "kind": "action",
    "slug": "action:sizzling-shenanigans",
    "name": "Sizzling Shenanigans",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["concentrate", "exploration", "manipulate"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "bastion-of-blasphemies"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Grampa Sizzle spends 1 minute telling a short tale about fire, after which one of the PCs must attempt a skill check to act the scene out. If a PC augments the scene by creating a magical fire effect using their own resources, the PC making the skill check gains a +2 status bonus to their check; if they instead attempt to do so with an illusion and Grampa Sizzle disbelieves the illusion with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "perception"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " check, the associated skill check instead gains a –2 status penalty. All four scenes must be completed in the following order, but which PC attempts which check is up to the party."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Scene 1:",
                  "marks": ["strong"]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " Grampa Sizzle tells the story of an aristocrat who sets his hat on fire when he tries to light his pipe ("
                },
                {
                  "type": "check",
                  "statistic": "skill:society",
                  "dc": 24
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " check or "
                },
                {
                  "type": "check",
                  "statistic": "skill:performance",
                  "dc": 26
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " check)."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Scene 2:",
                  "marks": ["strong"]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " Grampa Sizzle tells the story of a goblin who tries to ignite a drunkard's breath, only to get a face full of fire when the drunkard suddenly belches ("
                },
                {
                  "type": "check",
                  "statistic": "skill:stealth",
                  "dc": 24
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " check or "
                },
                {
                  "type": "check",
                  "statistic": "skill:thievery",
                  "dc": 26
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " check)."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Scene 3:",
                  "marks": ["strong"]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " Grampa Sizzle tells the story of a thief who sneaks into a giant's kitchen through an open window only to land on the giant's red-hot stovetop ("
                },
                {
                  "type": "check",
                  "statistic": "skill:acrobatics",
                  "dc": 24
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " check or "
                },
                {
                  "type": "check",
                  "statistic": "skill:athletics",
                  "dc": 26
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " check check)."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Scene 4:",
                  "marks": ["strong"]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " Grampa Sizzle tells the story of a bard who flirts with a fiery ifrit genie—awkward romantic shenanigans ensue ("
                },
                {
                  "type": "check",
                  "statistic": "skill:performance",
                  "dc": 24
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " check or "
                },
                {
                  "type": "check",
                  "statistic": "skill:diplomacy",
                  "dc": 26
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " check). Regardless of the scene, the results of a PC's check are as follows. If a PC takes fire damage, they can defend against it with a "
                },
                {
                  "type": "check",
                  "statistic": "save:reflex",
                  "dc": 24,
                  "basic": true
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " save."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The PC depicts the scene with wit, style, and perfect comedic timing. The party earns 2 Laughter Points."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Entertainment achieved, but with slight burns. The PC takes "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "2d6",
                "damageType": "fire"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage, and the party earns 1 Laughter Point."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The PC bungles the attempt and gets a painful and not-so-entertaining burn for their troubles. The PC takes "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "4d6",
                "damageType": "fire"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Catastrophic explosion or unexpected firestorm! Every PC takes "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "8d6",
                "damageType": "fire"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage, and the blast frightens the phantasmal crowd, causing the party to lose 1 Laughter Point."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
